ef=\"https://stiftung-behindertensport.de/\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noindex nofollow\">Link zur Stiftung</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://stiftung-behindertensport.de/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Antrag-Stand-2020_erweitert.pdf\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noindex nofollow\">Link zum Förderantrag</a></li>\n   </ul>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<aside>\n <div class=\"mb-10 max-w-sm\">\n  <figure class=\"ml-auto max-w-[600px]\">\n   <img src=\"https://foerderdatenbank.d-s-e-e.de/volumes/profiles/_article_m/logo_stiftung.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"394\">\n  </figure>\n </div>\n <div class=\"prose text-lg space-y-4\">\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"font-bold\">Regionen:</div>\n   <div>\n    <ul>\n     <li>Sachsen-Anhalt</li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"font-bold\">Engagementbereiche:</div>\n   <div>\n    <ul>\n     <li>Soziales</li>\n     <li>Sport und Bewegung</li>\n     <li>Sonstiges</li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"font-bold\">Bewerbungsfrist:</div>\n   <div class=\"mb-1\">Fortlaufende Förderung</div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</aside>";
